text c13 "toRna: RNA complement of adenine is uracil"
text s14 "ACGTGGTCTTAA"
text e15 "UGCACCAGAAUU"
text c16 "toRna: RNA complement"
note canonical case b4631f82-c98c-4a2f-90b3-c5c2b6c6f661
fn tc0 to bool
o = new uchar 1024 0
n = torna part z0 0 0 o
ret eq n 0
end
note canonical case a9558a3c-318c-4240-9256-5d5ed47005a6
